OL,3,GNEWSAFirm fined after worker hit by
OL,4,Atonne of metal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man suffered "life-changing" injuries
OL,7,Fwhen he was struck by a one-tonne metal
OL,8,Fhopper when it fell off a forklift
OL,9,Ftruck.
OL,11,FGary Taylor, who was 63 at the time,
OL,12,Fsuffered fractures to his skull, neck
OL,13,Fand spine, as well as two broken ribs
OL,14,Fand a severe cuts to his forehead when
OL,15,Fhe was hit by the insecure load.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
