OL,3,GNEWSAFirm fined after worker hit by
OL,4,Atonne of metal
OL,5,
OL,6,FManufacturing company E H Hassell &
OL,7,FSons Limited on Newstead Industrial
OL,8,FEstate in Trentham, Stoke-on-Trent, has
OL,9,Fbeen fined #300,000. It happened on 24
OL,10,FMarch 2025 and led to Taylor spending
OL,11,Fthree weeks in hospital as well as
OL,12,Fneeding seven months off work.
OL,14,FThe firm pleaded guilty to breaching
OL,15,Flifting regulations.
